fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ef7a353e0ac02b9b44cd87751b96bde4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/76f13452/uploads/origins/6f82c9aa-5620-4af7-8dec-732f2669bf1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ef7a353e0ac02b9b44cd87751b96bde4, https://si.imgix.net/76f13452/uploads/origins/6f82c9aa-5620-4af7-8dec-732f2669bf1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=828de93dd8f5efcff6905bf61104c861 2x, https://si.imgix.net/76f13452/uploads/origins/6f82c9aa-5620-4af7-8dec-732f2669bf1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1897d5826c2025459aa8be98c424dee6 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、私はあなたの絵とスターフォックスのキャラクターの描き方が大好きです。\n\nこれはちょっと違うけど、問題ないかな。私のOCをあなたのスターフォックスタイルで描いていただけないでしょうか。\n\n僕のOCの参考シート：https://www.furaffinity.net/view/51934631/\n\n必要なプロポーションに合うように、彼を好きなようにデザインし直すことができます。例えば、ファルコのようなキャラクターは翼を手として持っているので、彼の翼を取り除き、好きなように腕を変えることができます。\n\n彼はスターフォックススタイルのユニフォームを着ることもできますか？\n\nポーズは自由ですが、できれば今までの絵のような、どこか媚びているようなポーズを希望します。\nhttps://x.com/Ulala_ko/status/1776627575865139270\nhttps://x.com/Ulala_ko/status/1788223129380421846/photo/1\nhttps://x.com/Ulala_ko/status/1787039734122115544/photo/1\n\nありがとうございました！", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ulala_ko/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2338641, "client_id": 2845878, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e0ae713f/uploads/origins/480f0cd5-6dda-4f8a-82d6-f9540d511f14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26989c8a270b4c8dd84239ef4f53e506", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e0ae713f/uploads/origins/480f0cd5-6dda-4f8a-82d6-f9540d511f14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26989c8a270b4c8dd84239ef4f53e506, https://si.imgix.net/e0ae713f/uploads/origins/480f0cd5-6dda-4f8a-82d6-f9540d511f14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3488ee1d8e978594418656c3fdf87199 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e0ae713f/uploads/origins/480f0cd5-6dda-4f8a-82d6-f9540d511f14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b3eeb1627be590ecb77beea500cc085 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e0ae713f/uploads/origins/480f0cd5-6dda-4f8a-82d6-f9540d511f14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7cb9a5de11dbf6531c4298d77731c593", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e0ae713f/uploads/origins/480f0cd5-6dda-4f8a-82d6-f9540d511f14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7cb9a5de11dbf6531c4298d77731c593, https://si.imgix.net/e0ae713f/uploads/origins/480f0cd5-6dda-4f8a-82d6-f9540d511f14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8c1ec141e59acb81e83ed58864c84136 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e0ae713f/uploads/origins/480f0cd5-6dda-4f8a-82d6-f9540d511f14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f7d4cc7d050fb90fe5db9336b8eee0e1 3x"}, "body": "Hello from America ☆\n\nI would like to commission a Valentine's Day themed picture of Falco and Katt. I don't have any pose or background in mind, but would rather like to see what Ulalako-san comes up with. No real specific requests; just make it sweet, and sappy, and lovey-dovey, and all that good stuff. (笑)\n\nAs always, thank you for taking the time out of your busy schedule. I look forward to seeing the fruit of your talents.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ulala_ko/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2338641, "client_id": 2845878, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4e29a865/uploads/origins/f63295f2-f1e8-4eb7-b8ac-488200562842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db1317b70a692ea1fc4ccf58a1bb3c4d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4e29a865/uploads/origins/f63295f2-f1e8-4eb7-b8ac-488200562842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db1317b70a692ea1fc4ccf58a1bb3c4d, https://si.imgix.net/4e29a865/uploads/origins/f63295f2-f1e8-4eb7-b8ac-488200562842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86bd142ccd7220308a0e202105d6ff2e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4e29a865/uploads/origins/f63295f2-f1e8-4eb7-b8ac-488200562842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df280dee95605c03fa2aaa896fd390e6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4e29a865/uploads/origins/f63295f2-f1e8-4eb7-b8ac-488200562842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f2124c44b7002a27bac9e2df0cb0300b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4e29a865/uploads/origins/f63295f2-f1e8-4eb7-b8ac-488200562842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f2124c44b7002a27bac9e2df0cb0300b, https://si.imgix.net/4e29a865/uploads/origins/f63295f2-f1e8-4eb7-b8ac-488200562842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=69c8f28d957f3767cb7c0160b49f6de1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4e29a865/uploads/origins/f63295f2-f1e8-4eb7-b8ac-488200562842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0a9bfa2e71a8a7019e8876989af68116 3x"}, "body": "Hello from America ☆\n\nI loved the last piece I commissioned from you, and I would like to borrow your talents again if you would please. The idea: \n\nFalco and Katt are looking into each other's eyes. They're close to each other, and their height difference is prominent here. (So cute!) Perhaps they're holding onto one another, or one is gently cupping the other's chin in their hands. (Whatever you think looks best.) Lastly, decorate the piece with flowers like you do; it's so sweet.\n\nArigatou gozaimasu, and have a nice day!", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ulala_ko/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2338641, "client_id": 2242425, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0e2d8035/uploads/origins/a5a8177f-a63f-4a84-a2aa-04d9fe3e3f85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58aa82b48fab7a4381dd4fb0feef7170", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0e2d8035/uploads/origins/a5a8177f-a63f-4a84-a2aa-04d9fe3e3f85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58aa82b48fab7a4381dd4fb0feef7170, https://si.imgix.net/0e2d8035/uploads/origins/a5a8177f-a63f-4a84-a2aa-04d9fe3e3f85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=28d7f6a5681f0638bce6db7392bd548d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0e2d8035/uploads/origins/a5a8177f-a63f-4a84-a2aa-04d9fe3e3f85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8ee29e29fcc6936005ccb0e066f425e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0e2d8035/uploads/origins/a5a8177f-a63f-4a84-a2aa-04d9fe3e3f85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a4c11d91d1d54f1c1bfcec53a9e94118", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0e2d8035/uploads/origins/a5a8177f-a63f-4a84-a2aa-04d9fe3e3f85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a4c11d91d1d54f1c1bfcec53a9e94118, https://si.imgix.net/0e2d8035/uploads/origins/a5a8177f-a63f-4a84-a2aa-04d9fe3e3f85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6c6c302a1fc9f0bd832e1c5be3e2975d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0e2d8035/uploads/origins/a5a8177f-a63f-4a84-a2aa-04d9fe3e3f85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d45bbe3c526bd97cdab33c6ba7ab14a3 3x"}, "body": "やあ、君は本当にスターフォックスが好きなんだね。\n\nコルネリアの軍服を着た私のキャラクターを描きませんか？\n\nこの絵のような：\n\nhttps://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starfox/images/2/27/General_Pepper%27s_assistant.JPG/revision/latest?cb=20091113091145\n\nディテールは自由に決められます。\n\nありがとうございました！\n\n参考文献\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/2/folders/1NSQJwRMqdnhMXo7ezEo2CQ7d-RA_N_WJ\n\nその他の参考文献はこちら：\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@TailDoggo\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/2/folders/1vSNnGCucAT20CL5PITva3iXGSPCOUd8e", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ulala_ko/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2338641, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c4769cb8/uploads/origins/ae94997c-a62f-4c7e-b3da-6a0fa9088255?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b2b0efa11c4bf7b755f2c0dc2c41757", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c4769cb8/uploads/origins/ae94997c-a62f-4c7e-b3da-6a0fa9088255?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b2b0efa11c4bf7b755f2c0dc2c41757, https://si.imgix.net/c4769cb8/uploads/origins/ae94997c-a62f-4c7e-b3da-6a0fa9088255?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c8a1e5fa248d39c19e605e4329f6085 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c4769cb8/uploads/origins/ae94997c-a62f-4c7e-b3da-6a0fa9088255?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=476bb3d0f65ee7f3c89faf9361445bae 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c4769cb8/uploads/origins/ae94997c-a62f-4c7e-b3da-6a0fa9088255?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3de5d3179705476afe899868ceb36c6d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c4769cb8/uploads/origins/ae94997c-a62f-4c7e-b3da-6a0fa9088255?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3de5d3179705476afe899868ceb36c6d, https://si.imgix.net/c4769cb8/uploads/origins/ae94997c-a62f-4c7e-b3da-6a0fa9088255?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9369b38cee4661405ecf7f744ae9d43c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c4769cb8/uploads/origins/ae94997c-a62f-4c7e-b3da-6a0fa9088255?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a25a34f74f6b41b163ab2d83217346b1 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、アメリカ人です！\n\nできればウルフと私のネズミのキャラクターの画像をお願いしたいです。私のネズミのキャラクターの身長は8cmくらいです。\n\nアイデアはこうです：ネズミはウルフがこっそり捕まえたスパイです！\n\nリクエストとしては、ウルフが私のネズミのしっぽを顔の前にぶら下げているところを見たいです。ウルフはドヤ顔で、私のネズミはイライラしているか驚いているように見えるはずだ。好きであれば、彼は空中で少し暴れることもできる。\n\nウルフの服装は制服でも、もっとカジュアルなものでも構わない。\n\n僕のマウスはスターフォックスのユニフォームを着せたいので、参考資料を提供するが、好きなら即興で作ってくれて構わない。\n\nこれが私のマウスの参考資料です：\n\nhttps://media.discordapp.net/attachments/312998658822111234/813206511996108820/1611350648.png\n\nさらに、Starfoxの服を着ています：\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/432062667591778305/1142467520540971018/image.png\n\nこの度はありがとうございました！🐁✨", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ulala_ko/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2338641, "client_id": 2867653, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8fb2f71e/uploads/origins/3013dd9a-6740-444c-a572-a85d006388e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=884971e26bf5fa244b4d72b3c7447c47", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8fb2f71e/uploads/origins/3013dd9a-6740-444c-a572-a85d006388e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=884971e26bf5fa244b4d72b3c7447c47, https://si.imgix.net/8fb2f71e/uploads/origins/3013dd9a-6740-444c-a572-a85d006388e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfb19ce7febe345935f5c22692c31086 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8fb2f71e/uploads/origins/3013dd9a-6740-444c-a572-a85d006388e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23b74ce11302e2dad1bba86fc1abfc2e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8fb2f71e/uploads/origins/3013dd9a-6740-444c-a572-a85d006388e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4621a359d222dca0b55d755d230c3600", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8fb2f71e/uploads/origins/3013dd9a-6740-444c-a572-a85d006388e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4621a359d222dca0b55d755d230c3600, https://si.imgix.net/8fb2f71e/uploads/origins/3013dd9a-6740-444c-a572-a85d006388e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ce512b35aedf9e0ed2c3923034019a6f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8fb2f71e/uploads/origins/3013dd9a-6740-444c-a572-a85d006388e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=225e03911af77dc1523d916d7549b810 3x"}, "body": "Looking to do full body art of Krystal in the purple suit she wears from StarFox assault like we previously discussed.\n\nWill put a reference image of Krystal with the requested outfit in the \"reference URL\" section just in case it is needed \n\n-No background\n-no preference on a pose either.\n-Do whatever pose you think will fit well for the artwork\n\nTo clarify as well, the pose does not need to be the one in reference image. The image is just there so you know what outfit I'm requesting to be used in the artwork.\n\nThat's it! \nCan't wait to see it completed!\n\nhttps://krystalarchive.com/gallery/Promo.Assault/Promo.Assault.02.Pose2.jpg", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ulala_ko/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2338641, "client_id": 1556359, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/76b0c17d/uploads/origins/f75d8492-b3ee-4cc0-a51a-d3ea84517138?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a480ee2a01750555da5bf89d4424c1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/76b0c17d/uploads/origins/f75d8492-b3ee-4cc0-a51a-d3ea84517138?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10a480ee2a01750555da5bf89d4424c1, https://si.imgix.net/76b0c17d/uploads/origins/f75d8492-b3ee-4cc0-a51a-d3ea84517138?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=061af10de529a5335dbcc5f425751409 2x, https://si.imgix.net/76b0c17d/uploads/origins/f75d8492-b3ee-4cc0-a51a-d3ea84517138?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=309c1cd7a7040052ed319302082c562f 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/76b0c17d/uploads/origins/f75d8492-b3ee-4cc0-a51a-d3ea84517138?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3eec458088410bcf0aa9cb8cbcc58a47", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/76b0c17d/uploads/origins/f75d8492-b3ee-4cc0-a51a-d3ea84517138?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3eec458088410bcf0aa9cb8cbcc58a47, https://si.imgix.net/76b0c17d/uploads/origins/f75d8492-b3ee-4cc0-a51a-d3ea84517138?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=23b299071d1a1eb9364286804083bd6e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/76b0c17d/uploads/origins/f75d8492-b3ee-4cc0-a51a-d3ea84517138?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3a2c347215bcad00ae6b2b949997023b 3x"}, "body": "--外見---。\n-フォックスもウルフもパイロットユニフォームを着ている。(どのようなユニフォーム・スタイルを選んでも構わない。私は新しいのが好きなだけだ)。\n- フォックスのパイロット・ユニフォームは戦闘でダメージを受けた。\n---アクション\n-フォックスとウルフが戦いになり、ウルフがフォックスを倒して地面に倒れている。\n\nお疲れ様でした。\n\n追加リンク：https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starlink/images/e/e1/Wolf_Transparent.png/revision/latest/thumbnail/width/720/height/900?cb=20190604232452\n\nhttps://play.nintendo.com/images/Masthead_Fox.17345b1513ac044897cfc243542899dce541e8dc.9afde10b.png", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ulala_ko/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2338641, "client_id": 2845878, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a78985a8/uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3594843b35ad36d9960cab4784ccb951", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a78985a8/uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3594843b35ad36d9960cab4784ccb951, https://si.imgix.net/a78985a8/uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b30b27815c30e346392d768757863ae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a78985a8/uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02d3a4ffeeb546cd116bbc5fbcc52168 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a78985a8/uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=02a2e7b09df4da36032f4348466e3943", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a78985a8/uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=02a2e7b09df4da36032f4348466e3943, https://si.imgix.net/a78985a8/uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=65b5c959e8441a2d1bd2f1d96171a5ce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a78985a8/uploads/origins/780f07e6-cae2-4ae5-8b73-010718b63347?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=df4427741ace54ce5d2a13613bfbef81 3x"}, "body": "Hello from America ☆\n\nFalco and Katt are my favorite pairing in Star Fox. I am moved by their past, and they're just so cute together! I would to commission a piece if them in a loving embrace. ♡ The idea:\n\nFalco is behind Katt with his arms around her neck, gently hugging her. Katt has her hand (or hands) on his arms, returning the embrace. Their heads are turned toward one another; perhaps even they're nuzzling cheeks. ♡ If you would decorate the painting with flowers like I've seen in your other pictures, that would be wonderful. It's so sweet. Other than that, I leave the details up to you; eyes open/closed, what they're wearing, if anything, and whatever else you could think of. I trust your artistic talents, Ulalako-sensei. ☆\n\nThanks a ton!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ulala_ko/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2338641, "client_id": 1579697, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1d82e81a/uploads/origins/01003b2b-9ca1-4d08-82ef-a2d64e83f7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ddf8eadb904e315c5592cbcb559b88e6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1d82e81a/uploads/origins/01003b2b-9ca1-4d08-82ef-a2d64e83f7f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ddf8eadb904e315c5592cbcb559b88e6, https://si.imgix.net/